{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Whose.</b> Like צר, as in חרבות צורים (Joshua 5:2), for noun patterns interchange." "<b>And its wheels.</b> Like אופן מרכבותיו (Exodus 14:25), and they are known, and the sense of כסופה is that it comes swiftly, and the interpretation is like מוץ סופה."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:07.254449330Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}